        "TileImage": "$($repository 182a97da-9f67-427f-a6df-148a5ac84564).Image",
        "Description": "Ah, Whistlecreek. Just the most perfect white picket fence town,  squeeky clean for many a decade. Aint that asking for a little bit of splatter? Now, you may not be painting this town red, but with a bit of slice and dice...that oughta latch a knife onto the back of these perfect neighbourhood samaritans . Real 80s throwback.",
